**Highest-impact opportunity:** The existing `intersearch` infrastructure (nomic-embed-text-v1.5, SQLite vector storage) could provide the cheap candidate-generation layer. Embedding the document profile and retrieving top-30 agents via cosine similarity would reduce triage cost by ~85% (35K tokens/review) while the LLM reranker only scores the shortlist.
